+# Quick Start: Docker Auto-Update
+
+**Version**: 1.0.0  
+**Date**: 2026-03-31
+
+## Overview
+
+This guide helps you quickly set up and use the Docker auto-update feature for the Coding Plan Gateway.
+
+## Prerequisites
+
+- Docker 20.10+
+- Git repository access (HTTPS token or SSH key)
+- Container registry access (if pulling from registry)
+
+## Quick Start (5 minutes)
+
+### 1. Configure Environment Variables
+
+Create a `.env` file:
+
+```bash
+# Enable auto-update
+AUTOUPDATE_ENABLED=true
+AUTOUPDATE_BRANCH=master
+AUTOUPDATE_GIT_URL=https://github.com/your-org/coding-plan-gateway.git
+
+# HTTPS Token authentication (recommended for CI/CD)
+AUTOUPDATE_GIT_TOKEN=ghp_xxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxx
+
+# OR SSH Key authentication (recommended for production)
+# Mount SSH key as volume: -v ~/.ssh/id_rsa:/root/.ssh/id_rsa:ro
+
+# Optional settings
+AUTOUPDATE_MAX_RETRIES=3
+AUTOUPDATE_BACKUP_ENABLED=true
+```
+
+### 2. Build Docker Image
+
+```bash
+# Build the image
+docker build -t coding-plan-gateway:autoupdate .
+
+# Tag for registry (optional)
+docker tag coding-plan-gateway:autoupdate registry.example.com/cpg:autoupdate
+```
+
+### 3. Run Container
+
+```bash
+# Run with auto-update enabled
+docker run -d \
+  --name cpg-gateway \
+  --env-file .env \
+  -p 8080:8080 \
+  -v $(pwd)/config.yaml:/app/config.yaml:ro \
+  coding-plan-gateway:autoupdate
+```
+
+### 4. Verify Auto-Update
+
+Check logs to see auto-update in action:
+
+```bash
+# View container logs
+docker logs -f cpg-gateway
+```
+
+Expected output:
+```
+[2026-03-31T10:00:00Z] INFO: Auto-update enabled
+[2026-03-31T10:00:01Z] INFO: Checking for updates on branch: master
+[2026-03-31T10:00:02Z] INFO: Current commit: abc123def456
+[2026-03-31T10:00:03Z] INFO: Remote commit: abc123def456
+[2026-03-31T10:00:03Z] INFO: No updates available, starting with current version
+[2026-03-31T10:00:04Z] INFO: Gateway service started on port 8080
+```
+
+## Configuration Reference
+
+### Environment Variables
+
+| Variable | Default | Required | Description |
+|----------|---------|----------|-------------|
+| AUTOUPDATE_ENABLED | `true` | No | Enable/disable auto-update |
+| AUTOUPDATE_BRANCH | `master` | No | Git branch to track |
+| AUTOUPDATE_GIT_URL | - | Yes* | Git repository URL |
+| AUTOUPDATE_GIT_TOKEN | - | Yes* | HTTPS token for auth |
+| AUTOUPDATE_SSH_KEY_PATH | `/root/.ssh/id_rsa` | No | SSH key path |
+| AUTOUPDATE_MAX_RETRIES | `3` | No | Max retry attempts |
+| AUTOUPDATE_BACKUP_ENABLED | `true` | No | Enable build backup |
+
+\* Either `AUTOUPDATE_GIT_URL` + `AUTOUPDATE_GIT_TOKEN` (HTTPS) OR SSH key volume mount required.
+
+## Advanced Usage
+
+### SSH Key Authentication
+
+For production environments, SSH key authentication is recommended:
+
+```bash
+# Generate SSH key (if not exists)
+ssh-keygen -t ed25519 -C "cpg-autoupdate" -f ~/.ssh/cpg_autoupdate
+
+# Add public key to Git repository deploy keys
+cat ~/.ssh/cpg_autoupdate.pub
+
+# Run container with SSH key mounted
+docker run -d \
+  --name cpg-gateway \
+  -e AUTOUPDATE_ENABLED=true \
+  -e AUTOUPDATE_GIT_URL=git@github.com:your-org/coding-plan-gateway.git \
+  -e AUTOUPDATE_SSH_KEY_PATH=/root/.ssh/id_rsa \
+  -v ~/.ssh/cpg_autoupdate:/root/.ssh/id_rsa:ro \
+  -p 8080:8080 \
+  coding-plan-gateway:autoupdate
+```
+
+### Docker Compose
+
+```yaml
+version: '3.8'
+
+services:
+  gateway:
+    image: coding-plan-gateway:autoupdate
+    environment:
+      - AUTOUPDATE_ENABLED=true
+      - AUTOUPDATE_BRANCH=master
+      - AUTOUPDATE_GIT_URL=${GIT_URL}
+      - AUTOUPDATE_GIT_TOKEN=${GIT_TOKEN}
+      - AUTOUPDATE_MAX_RETRIES=3
+    volumes:
+      - ./config.yaml:/app/config.yaml:ro
+      - gateway-data:/app/data
+    ports:
+      - "8080:8080"
+    restart: unless-stopped
+
+volumes:
+  gateway-data:
+```
+
+### Kubernetes
+
+```yaml
+apiVersion: apps/v1
+kind: Deployment
+metadata:
+  name: coding-plan-gateway
+spec:
+  replicas: 1
+  selector:
+    matchLabels:
+      app: cpg-gateway
+  template:
+    metadata:
+      labels:
+        app: cpg-gateway
+    spec:
+      containers:
+      - name: gateway
+        image: registry.example.com/coding-plan-gateway:autoupdate
+        env:
+        - name: AUTOUPDATE_ENABLED
+          value: "true"
+        - name: AUTOUPDATE_BRANCH
+          value: "master"
+        - name: AUTOUPDATE_GIT_URL
+          valueFrom:
+            secretKeyRef:
+              name: git-credentials
+              key: url
+        - name: AUTOUPDATE_GIT_TOKEN
+          valueFrom:
+            secretKeyRef:
+              name: git-credentials
+              key: token
+        ports:
+        - containerPort: 8080
+        volumeMounts:
+        - name: config
+          mountPath: /app/config.yaml
+          subPath: config.yaml
+      volumes:
+      - name: config
+        configMap:
+          name: gateway-config
+```
+
+## Troubleshooting
+
+### Common Issues
+
+1. **Authentication Failed**
+   - Check `AUTOUPDATE_GIT_TOKEN` is set correctly
+   - Verify token has read access to repository
+   - For SSH: ensure key is mounted at correct path
+
+2. **Network Timeout**
+   - Check container has internet access
+   - Verify Git host is reachable from container
+   - Increase timeout if needed (environment-specific)
+
+3. **Build Fails**
+   - Check `npm run build` works locally
+   - Verify all dependencies in package.json
+   - Check Node.js version compatibility
+
+4. **Service Doesn't Start**
+   - Check logs: `docker logs cpg-gateway`
+   - Verify config.yaml is mounted correctly
+   - Check port 8080 is not already in use
+
+### Debug Mode
+
+Enable debug logging:
+
+```bash
+docker run -d \
+  --name cpg-gateway \
+  -e AUTOUPDATE_ENABLED=true \
+  -e AUTOUPDATE_GIT_URL=... \
+  -e LOG_LEVEL=debug \
+  -p 8080:8080 \
+  coding-plan-gateway:autoupdate
+```
